# STRAT-001: MedSync Health Company OKRs 2024

**Document ID:** STRAT-001
**Title:** Company Objectives and Key Results (OKRs) for Fiscal Year 2024
**Author:** Manus AI
**Date:** January 17, 2026
**Status:** Final

---

## 1. Executive Summary

The Fiscal Year 2024 OKRs for MedSync Health are designed to guide the company through its Series D growth phase and solidify its position as a market leader in healthcare technology. These objectives focus on three core pillars: **Financial Growth**, **Customer Expansion**, and **Organizational Scalability**.

All numeric targets are derived directly from the [Master Data Consistency Framework][1] and align with the annual financial plan (See FIN-001 for detailed financial targets). The successful execution of these OKRs will ensure we meet our revenue goals of **AED 485,100,000** and maintain a high-performance culture as we scale our team to **1,200 employees** by Q4 2024.

