## 2. Company Objectives and Key Results (OKRs)

### Objective 1: Achieve Market Leadership and Financial Growth

**Goal:** Exceeding the FY 2024 revenue target and strengthening market position to ensure a successful path to IPO.

| Key Result (KR) | Metric | Target (Commitment) | Stretch (Aspirational) | Q1 | Q2 | Q3 | Q4 |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **KR 1.1:** Increase Annual Recurring Revenue (ARR) to meet the FY 2024 total revenue target. | Total Revenue (AED) | **485,100,000** | 500,000,000 | 110,250,000 | 117,600,000 | 124,950,000 | 132,300,000 |
| **KR 1.2:** Maintain high revenue quality by achieving Net Revenue Retention (NRR) of at least. | NRR (%) | **118%** | 125% | 115% | 117% | 118% | 118% |
| **KR 1.3:** Improve Gross Margin to support future investment. | Gross Margin (%) | **75.0%** | 78.0% | 75.0% | 75.0% | 75.0% | 75.0% |
| **KR 1.4:** Successfully secure and close the Series D funding round. | Total Raised (AED) | **551,250,000** | N/A | N/A | Complete | N/A | N/A |

*Note: Quarterly revenue targets are provided for alignment (See FIN-001).*

### Objective 2: Scale Customer Base and Drive Product Adoption

**Goal:** Expanding the customer footprint and ensuring high customer satisfaction across all product lines, particularly in North America and EMEA.

| Key Result (KR) | Metric | Target (Commitment) | Stretch (Aspirational) |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **KR 2.1:** Increase the total number of unique customer organizations. | Total Customer Organizations | **3,930** | 4,200 |
| **KR 2.2:** Acquire new customers across all product lines. | New Customers Acquired | **890** | 1,000 |
| **KR 2.3:** Achieve an Overall Company Net Promoter Score (NPS) of at least. | Overall NPS | **71** | 75 |
| **KR 2.4:** Increase the percentage of customers using 3 or more MedSync products. | Cross-Sell Rate (%) | 25% | 30% |

*Note: Customer counts include Hospitals (520), Clinics (3,200), and Insurance Providers (210) as of end of FY 2024 (See SALES-001 for detailed customer metrics).*

### Objective 3: Build a High-Performance, Scalable Organization

**Goal:** Investing in talent, infrastructure, and operational excellence to support rapid growth and maintain a world-class team.

| Key Result (KR) | Metric | Target (Commitment) | Stretch (Aspirational) |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **KR 3.1:** Scale the global team to support growth and market expansion. | Total Headcount (Q4 2024) | **1,200** | 1,250 |
| **KR 3.2:** Maintain a healthy and sustainable work environment. | Voluntary Attrition Rate (%) | **< 12.5%** | < 10.0% |
| **KR 3.3:** Improve operational efficiency and reduce time-to-market for new features. | R&D OpEx as % of Revenue | **< 36%** | < 34% |
| **KR 3.4:** Ensure all critical compliance certifications are renewed and maintained. | Compliance Status | **100%** (SOC 2 Type II, ISO 27001, HIPAA, GDPR) | N/A |

*Note: Headcount growth is planned across all departments, with a focus on Engineering (380) and Sales (220) (See HR-001 for detailed headcount plan).*

