## 3. Quarterly Alignment (Q1 2024 Focus)

The focus for Q1 2024 is on executing the initial phase of the Series D growth plan, specifically targeting the Q1 revenue of **AED 110,250,000** and increasing the headcount to **1,120**.

| Objective | Q1 2024 Key Focus |
| :--- | :--- |
| **O1: Financial Growth** | Achieve Q1 Revenue of AED 110,250,000. Finalize Series D documentation. |
| **O2: Customer Expansion** | Onboard 25% of the annual new customer target (approx. 223 new customers). |
| **O3: Organizational Scalability** | Complete Q1 hiring plan to reach 1,120 employees. Review and optimize R&D spending. |

